    "text": "A certain buffer solution contains equal concentration of <math><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></math> and <math>\r <mrow>\r  <mtext>HX</mtext></mrow>\r</math>. The <math><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></math> for <math>\r <mrow>\r  <mtext>HX</mtext></mrow>\r</math>\r is <math><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup></math>. The <math>\r <mrow>\r  <mtext>pH</mtext></mrow>\r</math>\r of the buffer is",
