  "solution": {
    "text": "The Henderson equation is <br/><math><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">p</mi><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">o</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">n</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">j</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">u</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">g</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">t</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">e</mi><mtext>base</mtext></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">A</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">c</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">i</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">d</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><msub><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">a</mi></mrow></msub></mrow></mrow><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mrow></math>  <br/>Hence, <math><mo>[</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">H</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi><mo>]</mo><mo>=</mo><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">X</mi></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math>  <br/><math><mo>=</mo><mo>-</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mo>(</mo></mrow></mrow><mn>1</mn><msup><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow></msup><mo>)</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\"></mi><mo>+</mo><mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">log</mi></mrow><mo>⁡</mo><mrow><mn>1</mn></mrow></mrow></math>  <br/>or pH = 8.0.",
